# expect: ex:CustomUse bddo:FieldShape sh:InConstraintComponent sh:Warning
# A field that USES a profile-minted encoding. The description is valid: validation reports no
# Violation. Its only result is the advisory one above, which tells the author that only a
# processor supporting IBM437 can decode the field.
@prefix bddo: <https://hexplain.io/ns/bddo#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix sh:   <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/enc#> .

ex:cp437 a bddo:CustomEncoding ; rdfs:label "IBM PC code page 437" ; bddo:ianaCharset "IBM437" .
ex:CustomUse a bddo:Field ; bddo:dataType bddo:string ; bddo:size 8 ; bddo:encoding ex:cp437 .
